{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301161","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301161","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430116101:0":{"text":"아, 소개하는 걸 잊었군. 그린트와 인디고 블루는 내가 만든 단검과 방패야.","source_cn":"哦，忘了介绍，小光和大蓝是我锻造的短剑和盾牌。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC39C947ADBE7CF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430116102:0":{"text":"녀석들은 완성되는 순간부터 언젠가는 저 멀리 사바나로 떠나야 할 운명이었지.","source_cn":"它们在被锻造完成之时就已经注定要离我而去，去到遥远的赛凡纳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABDACB4EF4494984","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430116103:0":{"text":"그래서 제작자인 나로선 당연히 좀 아쉽기도 하고.","source_cn":"而我作为它们的创造者，当然会有些不舍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA50F3E280268F28C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:工匠弗瑞":{"text":"장인 프리","source":"工匠弗瑞","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}